  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WAN-IFRA Strengthening independent media programme 2023-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Goal of the Supporting Independent Media programme is to promote safe, financially healthy, gender inclusive, and trustworhty media organisations in selected ODA-eligible countries in Africa and Asia. Outcomes: Media partners apply strategies to protect staff against safety threats; Media partners apply techniques to protect staff from sexual harassment; Media partners apply business strategies and best practice; Women journalists and other vulnerable groups progress in their career to more senior professional roles; Media partners apply gender equality, diversity and inclusion strategies and best practice.</narrative>
  </description>
